{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "cocos-smoke",
    "name": "Cocos API — Smoke",
    "description": "Comprueba búsqueda, catálogo, cartera y errores con la semilla inicial. Ejecutá primero el script de demo y elegí el entorno local. Las solicitudes dejan intactas las órdenes.\r\n\r\nDesde la raíz: npx newman run delivery/postman/cocos-smoke.postman_collection.json -e delivery/postman/local.postman_environment.json",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://127.0.0.1:3001"
    }
  ],
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "test",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "pm.test('incluye X-Request-Id', function () {",
          "  const requestId = pm.response.headers.get('X-Request-Id');",
          "  pm.expect(requestId).to.match(/^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[1-8][0-9a-f]{3}-[89ab][0-9a-f]{3}-[0-9a-f]{12}$/i);",
          "});",
          "",
          "pm.test('responde en menos de 2 segundos', function () {",
          "  pm.expect(pm.response.responseTime).to.be.below(2000);",
          "});"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
